{"text":"What I would like to do this afternoon is to walk you through the key, or I should say remind you, because I know this audience is very familiar with these issues, is to walk you through a handful of key structural changes that were occurring before the global pandemic that have essentially been accelerated in the period that we continue to deal with today. I'm going to go through them in no particular order, but it's important that we recognize that although this suite of challenges is structural, not only has the pandemic catalyzed or sped the challenges to make them more urgent, but also, as you will quickly notice, I am not going to spend a lot of time on the tactical challenges that the global economy is dealing with today.","words":[{"text":"What","start":0.56,"end":0.9},{"text":"I","start":0.9,"end":1.06},{"text":"would","start":1.06,"end":1.2},{"text":"like","start":1.2,"end":1.44},{"text":"to","start":1.44,"end":1.68},{"text":"do","start":1.68,"end":2.02},{"text":"this","start":2.02,"end":2.44},{"text":"afternoon","start":2.44,"end":2.96},{"text":"is","start":2.96,"end":3.64},{"text":"to","start":3.64,"end":3.88},{"text":"walk","start":3.88,"end":4.16},{"text":"you","start":4.16,"end":4.52},{"text":"through","start":4.52,"end":4.8},{"text":"the","start":4.8,"end":5.16},{"text":"key","start":5.16,"end":5.64,"punct":","},{"text":"or","start":5.82,"end":6.0},{"text":"I","start":6.0,"end":6.1},{"text":"should","start":6.1,"end":6.22},{"text":"say","start":6.22,"end":6.44},{"text":"remind","start":6.44,"end":6.84},{"text":"you","start":6.84,"end":7.1,"punct":","},{"text":"because","start":7.32,"end":7.34},{"text":"I","start":7.34,"end":7.48},{"text":"know","start":7.48,"end":7.68},{"text":"this","start":7.68,"end":7.94},{"text":"audience","start":7.94,"end":8.48},{"text":"is","start":8.48,"end":8.74},{"text":"very","start":8.74,"end":8.9},{"text":"familiar","start":8.9,"end":9.24},{"text":"with","start":9.24,"end":9.54},{"text":"these","start":9.54,"end